ve an unsettling atmosphere. I look forward to working with you!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wawon_wwn/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 965994, "client_id": 123373, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c69024ce/requests/285758_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c37aa315f8554d125f9eca3758cf8459", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c69024ce/requests/285758_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c37aa315f8554d125f9eca3758cf8459, https://si.imgix.net/c69024ce/requests/285758_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dc7f8773b3152e2d27b44cd82e9a677 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c69024ce/requests/285758_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb7815fead0fa8a4e60318cb28db1a2e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c69024ce/requests/285758_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e0df52ed2f1fa1d0fb2a08d66089f6f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c69024ce/requests/285758_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e0df52ed2f1fa1d0fb2a08d66089f6f, https://si.imgix.net/c69024ce/requests/285758_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=af93eab2602b542c41ae96ffe7bb2b45 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c69024ce/requests/285758_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=112bc57d45d4d467c8fd1a2bd1a9217d 3x"}, "body": "you (nuance of either deep affection or contempt)\n\nNice to meet you, my name is Razaanya.\n\nI was impressed by the way you used lines in your illustrations (especially in your latest two works), so\nso I sent this request to you.\n\nI'm a live-streamer on YouTube in the form of Bami-niku, and I'd like you to draw my character (myself)!\n\nThe pose, composition, clothes, accessories, etc. can be done as you like.\nYou can draw the pose, the composition, the clothes, the accessories, etc. as you like, but the hair style, the hair color, the eye color, and the ribbon are the images that leave the identity.\n\nThe illustrations you draw will be used for the following purposes.\n　Personal viewing\n　Use on SNS\n　Video thumbnails\n\nWe will not use them for commercial purposes.\n\nWe have a web page with full body images as a reference URL.\n\nWe look forward to your consideration.\n\nhttps://razanixya.myportfolio.com/visuals", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wawon_wwn/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 965994, "client_id": 967862, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c35f2260/requests/277352_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=369ff5c6388d83a324d155931f63b3d7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c35f2260/requests/277352_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=369ff5c6388d83a324d155931f63b3d7, https://si.imgix.net/c35f2260/requests/277352_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b915db74d3f77a761a409b5e1ab645bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c35f2260/requests/277352_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84884543fcb6308d3c49732a4cf0f52c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c35f2260/requests/277352_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2487c39f2b067c37e3469d69f11b73be", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c35f2260/requests/277352_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2487c39f2b067c37e3469d69f11b73be, https://si.imgix.net/c35f2260/requests/277352_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=04714305ad360fe05cae4acb09369f5b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c35f2260/requests/277352_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=61fe145ac83357ca6af06016ce90d19d 3x"}, "body": "Wa-on, nice to meet you. I always watch the Niji Sanji Hyakki Yagou series that you draw. I would like to request you to draw \"The Messers of Niji Sanji Hyakki Yagou who are viewing cherry blossoms\".\nWhen the acceptance started, I wasn't sure who to ask Wa-on-san to draw, but at first I wanted my guess to be drawn by my favorite artist, so I made the request.\n\n\nDetails\nAkina: She's eating the bento and dumplings she brought with her. She is holding onigiri (rice balls) and dango (dumplings) in both hands to give the feeling of \"appetite > hanami\".\nFuwachi: He's drinking Hanami sake. His hairstyle is his normal hairstyle (since that one was a new costume ver)\nMayu: He's inwardly enjoying the hanami in Mesha, and his expression is smiling gently.\nOther: the three muscots (Kamekku-kun, Uchina Irokiro, and Fuwatchi Cruller) are also with him.\n\n\nIt's okay to go at your pace, Wagon. I look forward to working with you.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wawon_wwn/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 965994, "client_id": 219944, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a8eb652d/requests/264252_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa023a701d529e0e4eef8e716021f19f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a8eb652d/requests/264252_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa023a701d529e0e4eef8e716021f19f, https://si.imgix.net/a8eb652d/requests/264252_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b320fb1b6d9e1b8f692add7cb25a901 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a8eb652d/requests/264252_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cf1e72cae7178cf847a78e4c427db45 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a8eb652d/requests/264252_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e79e96716d34824e818e946dd459ae4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a8eb652d/requests/264252_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e79e96716d34824e818e946dd459ae4, https://si.imgix.net/a8eb652d/requests/264252_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b08ff611b6cea5a2af36c6dd790a12d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a8eb652d/requests/264252_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed0a973cedc7166757d5c1810be97308 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI've been wanting you to draw a picture of Tomoe and Kenya when they appear together in Niji Sanji Hyakki Yagou, so I sent you a request right away!\n\nWhat I would like you to draw is\nTomoe, the Spider, is messing with Kenya from behind.\nShe is holding her left hand around Kenya's cheek, shoulder and waist.\nShe is grabbing Kenya's right wrist with one of her right hands and trying to pull him closer.\nIt is an illustration of the composition.\n\nI'd like everyone to see this illustration for propagation purposes, so when you tweet it on Twitter, please tag it with #tomoe #irasukoya, and if possible, please don't add the word sample.\nThank you very much!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wawon_wwn/works/5", 